1
00:00:59,359 --> 00:01:00,240
What exactly happened?

2
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,719
Did you see the killer?

3
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:04,359
This room

4
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,200
was originally Master Li's bedroom.

5
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:09,680
Mengzhu switched rooms with Master Li.

6
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,599
So the killer's target

7
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:15,560
must have been Master Li.

8
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:28,200
Someone's trying to kill me!

9
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:31,239
Where are you going?

10
00:01:31,599 --> 00:01:32,359
Come back to the station with me!

11
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:32,959
Come here!

12
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,480
Help me, Chief Mu!

13
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:40,799
Someone's trying to kill me!

14
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:41,680
What?

15
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,200
Someone's trying to kill you?

16
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:45,000
It's absolutely true!

17
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,959
Mengzhu took the hit for me.

18
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:47,640
Otherwise,

19
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,959
I would've been the one who died that night!

20
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,959
Oh, my Great Philanthropist Li.

21
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:55,120
You're the pillar of our Lijia Town!

22
00:01:55,319 --> 00:01:56,359
We're all counting on you.

23
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,000
Don't worry.

24
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,599
We'll send someone to protect you immediately.

25
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,840
Detective Mu is already at the mansion.

26
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,599
With Mu Ying protecting you,

27
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,439
all those monsters and ghosts will have to steer clear.

28
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,560
She alone

29
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,599
is worth the entire Lijia Town police station.

30
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,639
Chief Mu.

31
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:16,240
Mu Ying can protect me for a while,

32
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,879
but she can't protect me forever.

33
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,400
Then...

34
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,120
Then what do you mean?

35
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:25,759
Chief Mu,

36
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,400
didn't you want to be promoted to

37
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,000
the Provincial Police Headquarters?

38
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:34,919
I can put in a word with Marshal Ma

39
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:38,479
and have him save the chief's position for you.

40
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,000
How about it?

41
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,439
You... You're friends with Marshal Ma?

42
00:02:43,599 --> 00:02:45,479
For Marshal Ma's provincial garrison,

43
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:47,400
I've provided a lot of military funding.

44
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,960
A mere chief's position

45
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:50,240
is a piece of cake.

46
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,319
From now on... Good!

47
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,919
What belongs to the Li family

48
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:57,120
belongs to the Mu family!

49
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,080
Deal!

50
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:05,400
What?

51
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,680
You want me to marry Philanthropist Li?

52
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:07,360
Are you crazy?

53
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,319
First thing tomorrow morning,

54
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,120
I'll call the provincial chief

55
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,439
and tell him that Detective Mu

56
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,240
has achieved nothing in Lijia Town

57
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,199
and failed the station's expectations,

58
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:18,400
and is now requesting to resign as detective.

59
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:20,240
Just be a good girl and get married,

60
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,719
and live a peaceful life.

61
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:22,240
Don't...

62
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,240
Don't make the call!

63
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,319
Let me out!

64
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,319
I'm not getting married!

65
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,280
Dad, let me out!

66
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:28,199
Philanthropist Li

67
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,400
will come pick you up early tomorrow morning for the wedding.

68
00:03:30,639 --> 00:03:31,319
If you marry him,

69
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,639
I guarantee you'll be well provided for.

70
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:33,840
Keep a close eye on her.

71
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,120
If anything goes wrong, you'll be held responsible!

72
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,199
- Rest assured, Chief. - Let me out!

73
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,479
Even if the Young Miss had extraordinary powers,

74
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:38,360
she wouldn't be able to escape.

75
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,000
Let me out!

76
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,439
Young Miss,

77
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:46,159
you'll be a bride tomorrow morning.

78
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,639
Get some rest early.

79
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:50,960
I don't want to!

80
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:51,919
Open it!

81
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:53,719
Let me out!

82
00:04:07,879 --> 00:04:08,400
Master.

83
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,080
The Li Mansion is haunted.

84
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,319
Are we really going in?

85
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,479
We must go in.

86
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,479
The book, Heavenly Craftsmanship,

87
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:17,000
is our family heirloom.

88
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,639
That day at the Li Mansion,

89
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,759
I saw the box it's kept in.

90
00:04:23,759 --> 00:04:24,319
That proves

91
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,600
that Heavenly Craftsmanship

92
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,680
is inside the Li Mansion.

93
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:27,959
So,

94
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,399
I have to find it no matter what.

95
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:37,240
Let's go.

96
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,079
Come on.

97
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,959
The vase has a flowing cloud pattern.

98
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:07,920
I've seen it in ancient books.

99
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,079
It's unique to the ancient Yuncang Kingdom.

100
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,319
Master.

101
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:13,720
I need to use the bathroom.

102
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,680
Come with me.

103
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:20,279
You're such a handful.

104
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:21,720
Let's go, let's go.

105
00:05:45,639 --> 00:05:46,240
Master.

106
00:05:47,279 --> 00:05:48,079
I'm scared.

107
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,040
Let's go.

108
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,480
Look at you, such a coward.

109
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,639
Useless.

110
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,360
Master.

111
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,160
What is it now?

112
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,879
I think something's following us.

113
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,279
Master, Master!

114
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:15,920
Master!

115
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,360
Wait for me, Master!

116
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:18,240
Master.

117
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,600
It's so late, maybe...

118
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,879
Tomorrow morning at seven,

119
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,480
I'll be marrying Mu Ying.

120
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:24,680
Make sure you get the mansion

121
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,480
decorated properly.

122
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,560
The wedding must be festive.

123
00:06:27,959 --> 00:06:28,839
Get plenty of flowers.

124
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:31,519
Congratulations, Master.

125
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:34,360
I'll go prepare right away.

126
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:39,319
The She-devil is marrying Master Li!

127
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:41,480
Oh no.

128
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:43,240
Mu Ying must be in trouble.

129
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:44,720
Let's go.

130
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,079
I was wondering why, since leaving the Li Mansion this morning,

131
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,240
we hadn't seen her again.

132
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:04,759
Turns out her dad locked her up.

133
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,600
There are guards inside. What do we do?

134
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:16,079
Watch this.

135
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,680
Master.

136
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:24,639
Pingkang Fang. We need a fourth!

137
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,480
Waiting for someone?

138
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,399
Where do you need a fourth?

139
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:28,920
Pingkang Fang!

140
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,199
What are you waiting for? Hurry up and go!

141
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,360
Thanks, man!

142
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,079
Master.

143
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:42,639
You sent him away with just one sentence?

144
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,120
Of course.

145
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:45,639
He was leaning forward,

146
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,519
had dark circles under his eyes,

147
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,279
and even had a die hanging from his waist.

148
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:50,120
A typical gambler.

149
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,360
The nearest gambling house from here

150
00:07:52,519 --> 00:07:53,600
is at least one li away.

151
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,759
It'll take him a while to get there.

152
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,839
Why is it you two?

153
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:05,399
You saved me once before,

154
00:08:05,839 --> 00:08:06,879
now I'm returning the favor.

155
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:07,759
We're even.

156
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,319
What do you mean, even?

157
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:10,639
Tell me the truth.

158
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:11,680
Why did you help me?

159
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:14,920
Isn't it obvious?

160
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:16,839
My Master likes you!

161
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:18,680
Shut up!

162
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:21,319
No, no.

163
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:22,639
It's not what he said.

164
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:23,399
Well,

165
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:25,759
as for why I want to help you solve the case,

166
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,040
I'll find a chance to tell you later.

167
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,040
By the way,

168
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,519
we only have six hours left until dawn.

169
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,759
If you don't want to marry Master Li,

170
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,879
we should work together to solve this quickly.

171
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:37,919
True.

172
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:40,080
I worked so hard to become a detective.

173
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:42,440
Being a detective is so boring.

174
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,480
I think

175
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,080
you'd be better off marrying Master Li.

176
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,879
You'd eat and drink the best every day.

177
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,720
And at night, you'd have ghosts to play with.

178
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,919
How fun! Are you sick in the head?

179
00:08:49,919 --> 00:08:50,759
Why don't you marry him?

180
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:51,559
I'm looking out for you! Bring up marriage again,

181
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,200
and I'll... In the future,

182
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,879
watch out or I'll beat you up!

183
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,320
What are you waiting for? Let's go.

184
00:09:04,799 --> 00:09:05,960
We have to, before dawn,

185
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,120
which means within six hours,

186
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,080
solve the Li family murders.

187
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,519
I will use my identity as the young mistress of the Li family

188
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:11,159
as a cover

189
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,759
to gain the Li family's trust

190
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,039
and get more clues.

191
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,159
Coming, coming!

192
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,519
Madam.

193
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:22,720
Where is Philanthropist Li?

194
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,120
Master Li went back to his room.

195
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,320
Aren't you two getting married tomorrow morning?

196
00:09:27,519 --> 00:09:28,440
You're just in time, Madam.

197
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,960
I'm preparing your wedding dress.

198
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,240
I know about the wedding.

199
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,600
That's exactly why I'm here.

200
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,360
Within four months,

201
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,559
four women died in the Li Mansion.

202
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:52,200
All causes of death were accidental.

203
00:09:55,039 --> 00:09:56,480
We now know

204
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,480
the method used to kill Mengzhu.

205
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:00,879
But...

206
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,759
the hidden weapons and needles on the puppet,

207
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,159
as well as the murder weapon,

208
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,840
we haven't found any of them.

209
00:10:07,759 --> 00:10:09,159
And we have no clue about the killer.

210
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,799
The Li Mansion is so big,

211
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,279
where are we supposed to look?

212
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:15,639
Madam.

213
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:18,639
Madam.

214
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,879
This wedding dress was left by First Wife.

215
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,240
You two are about the same size.

216
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,960
Try it on first to see if it fits.

217
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:24,919
First Wife?

218
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:27,600
Do you remember

219
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,320
how First Wife died?

220
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,679
First Wife...

221
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,080
her soul was taken by the Flower Demon.

222
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:36,559
The Flower Demon?

223
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:38,039
That's right.

224
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,039
It was the Flower Demon.

225
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,600
After First Wife died,

226
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,440
she turned into the Flower Demon.

227
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,559
Whenever night falls,

228
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,600
she returns to the Li Mansion.

229
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,320
First Wife!

230
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,879
First Wife is back!

231
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,480
First Wife!
